<!-- WoW loads a Bindings.xml at the addon root by itself; it must NOT be
     listed in the TOC as well, or every binding registers twice.
     The action names are permanent: WoW stores keybinds against the action
     string, so renaming one would unbind every ring players have set up.
     Display strings live in Locales (BINDING_HEADER_/BINDING_NAME_ globals),
     set inside OnLocaleReady by Modules/ActionRing.lua. -->
